<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-vēlo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to unveil</i>, <i>uncover</i>, <i>lay bare</i> (not ante-Aug.;
			syn.: patefacio, aperio, nudo, retego). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caput (opp. involvere),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Galb. 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frontem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. G.
					31</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					6, 619</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pectus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					4, 2, 71</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carpenta (opp. contegere),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 10, p. 247</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					11, 73</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to disclose</i>, <i>reveal</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fraudes (with detegere),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 9, p. 229</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnia (tempus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 7 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">justitiam et salutem Domini cunctis gentibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. in Isa. 15, 56, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Psa. 28, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Matt.
				10, 26</span></i> et saep.: Ulixes Eumaeo, quis sit, revelat.
					<i><span class="en">Aus. Per. Od. 21</span></i>. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
